 445               /OF THE BUFFER WILL BE IN THE ADDRESS FOLLOWING THE COALL.  C8 PRINTING OF THE BUFFER
 446               /WILL STOP WHEN A 00 CHAR IS DETECTED. CHARACTERS ARE PACKED 2 PER WORD.
