 853               /
 854               /THE FOLLOWING PROGRAM LOCATIONS "OD", "ID", "FIRST", AND "LAST" MAY BE
 855               /CHANGED BY THE OPERATOR MANUALLY HOWEVER FOLLOWING THESE RESTRICTIONS.
 856               /
 857               /               1.  THE CONTENTS OF " OD " (MIN VAL 0) MUST BE <= THE
 858               /                   CONTENTS OF " ID " (MAX VALUE 114).
 859               /
 860               /               2.  THE CONTENTS OF " FIRST " (MIN VAL 1) MUST BE <= THE
 861               /                   CONTENTS OF " LAST " (MAX VALUE 32)
 862               /
 863               /THE PROGRAM INITIALLY SETS THESE VALUES AT PROGRAM LOAD TIME
 864               /
 865               / (OD) = 52, AND (ID) = 53
 866               /
 867               /BECAUSE TRACK 53 IS THE TRACK AT WHICH THE RX01 MICROCONTROLLER WILL
 868               /DECREASE THE WRITE CURRENT IN HALF
